      "observation_pain_point": "The dual-reviewer control for balance-sheet reconciliations above $50K exists in practice but is not documented in any policy and is not enforced by the reconciliation tool — 'it lives in people's heads'. This creates key-person dependency and an audit/SOX evidencing risk.",
